{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{"tools":{},"resources":{}},"serverInfo":{"name":"devpost-platform-mcp","version":"1.0.0"},"instructions":"Devpost's hackathon platform. Every tool call requires authentication (a Bearer token). Authenticated users can read hackathon details (overview, dates, prizes, judging criteria, rules, announcements), search and list hackathons, view their own projects and submissions, register for a hackathon, and create, update, thumbnail, and submit projects. Resolve a hackathon by URL, slug, or numeric ID. Always confirm rule/eligibility agreement before registering or submitting."}}